claim_principal: "harness:claude-code#8fcf1176eceedef40be11ce4"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "The packed distribution is at least 1.5 MB below the 20,000,000 B base ceiling on a clean build; Export names, module paths and declarations are unchanged and composed source maps keep original names, proven by the runtime compaction spec; A repeated finalization leaves an unchanged output and its source map byte-identical; The packed npx and bunx smoke passes"
